# STRIDE DFD: mobile banking client crosses public, application, and core-banking trust zones.
threatmodel "Mobile Banking STRIDE"
external Customer: Mobile Customer
external SMS: SMS Gateway
process App: Mobile App Backend
process Auth: Identity Service
datastore Accounts: Core Accounts Store
datastore Audit: Transaction Audit Log
Customer -> App : TLS API request
App -> Auth : login token
Auth -> Accounts : identity lookup
App -> Accounts : transfer instruction
App -> Audit : transaction event
App -> SMS : OTP request
boundary "Mobile Network" { Customer, SMS }
boundary "Bank Edge" { App, Auth }
boundary "Core Banking" { Accounts, Audit }
